Dutch Baby

3 large eggs
6 T flour
1 T granulated sugar
6 T milk
3 T butter

melt butter in 10-12 inch cast-iron frying
pan in oven at 425, just above the center.
Leave it in there 2-3 minutes so it gets
good and hot.

Blend the rest of the ingrediments till
smooth.  (blender).

Pour batter into hot frying pan and swirl
it around.  Put it back in the oven and 
bake about 15 minutes.

Serve with lemon and powdered sugar.
